# ディスク操作の〈状態表示〉 (design 11.26) away from a link: the system's
# disk. The panel of the program ディスク操作 stands in the middle of the
# screen; its labels and values are shot to see how they stand (the
# values next to their labels, nothing left empty under them, 終了 at the
# foot under the values). The first window is made larger; ディスク操作 is
# at 440,480 the first time the menu opens at 400,300, its submenu 接続,
# 切り離し, 状態表示, 区画作成, 拡張, 20 pixels apart from 481.
click 250 60
wait 300
drag 346 222 620 420
wait 500
click 400 300 1
wait 300
move 430 480
wait 150
move 440 480
wait 300
move 510 480
wait 150
move 530 481
wait 300
move 530 521
wait 300
click 530 521
expect disk: status "TessronOS system"
expect diskop: up status
wait 1000
shot disk_status
key 28
expect diskop: status closed
